Package: wxpipe
Title: Extract-and-Load Pipeline for Salzburg Weather Observations and Forecasts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Andreas", "Rohland", , "andreas.rohland@posteo.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ingests daily station observations from the GeoSphere Austria
    Data Hub and numerical weather forecasts from Open-Meteo, lands the
    unmodified API payloads in Google Cloud Storage and loads tidy,
    append-only tables into BigQuery. Designed to run as a scheduled Cloud
    Run Job; downstream modelling (dbt) and serving (Plumber) live elsewhere.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/andreasrohland/weather-forecast-checker
